    "updated_at": "2018-11-12T16:36:44Z",
    "body": "Some clarification notes, that came up while talking to @annevk:\r\n* when a float16 canvas is created, we default to extended-SRGB color space\r\n* we need a defined behavior for putImageData of `float16` to `uint8`: clamp from 0 to 1.\r\n* there's no known primitive in web platform to specificy this `float16` backing storage. We are up to suggestions of better alternatives.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
