    "body": "This is a summary of the IDL changes proposed by w3ctag/design-reviews#315.\r\n\r\nThis is also a subset of the [original proposal](https://github.com/WICG/canvas-color-space/blob/master/CanvasColorSpaceProposal.md), that included color spaces specification and that was discussed on #299. So those two are a superset of what's being proposed here.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
