    "created_at": "2018-11-14T19:48:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-11-14T19:48:35Z",
    "body": "Do you envision the entire canvas pipeline running at float16 when CanvasPixelFormat is set to \"float16\"?\r\n\r\nWhat is the functionality that those applications need from canvas? Naively, I can't think of much overlap between the canvas api and the needs of a photo editor.",
