    "created_at": "2018-11-28T01:45:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-11-28T01:45:44Z",
    "body": "> CoreGraphics doesn't seem to support a 16bit float pixel format. Do you know what Apple's feedback on this proposal is?\r\n\r\nCG does support half-float pixel formats on both its GPU-accelerated and non-accelerated code paths, so we support this proposal.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
